{
  "statement": "Sustainability is crucial for modern systems, and my requirements aim to minimize environmental impact through energy-efficient algorithms (GRN-01) and cloud-based solutions (GRN-02). Document digitization (GRN-03) significantly reduces paper usage, while tracking lifecycle resource impacts (GRN-04) helps identify areas for improvement. I propose to provide users with sustainability reports (GRN-05) and enable carbon offset options (GRN-06) to promote responsible financial behavior. Compliance with sustainability regulations (GRN-07) ensures the system adheres to necessary standards, making it essential for a responsible bookkeeping solution.",
